        "a": "Google says that if the user selects Cancel on the permissions request screen twice in a row, your app should show a dedicated screen, and that once it is displayed, users need to re-enable permissions from within the Health Connect settings menu. Plan a path that sends the user to settings rather than relaunching the request."
